[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733806437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114839#issuecomment-3733806437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114839","id":3733806437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ejV1l","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T01:34:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T01:34:27Z","body":"Oh wow. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/85c75da4ad8a01e1f9e25620872560293ac70b51/thirdparty/basis_universal/transcoder/basisu.h#L3\r\n\r\nI guess we are lucky we didn't run into the issue earlier. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733806437/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734474396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114839#issuecomment-3734474396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114839","id":3734474396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7el46c","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T12:14:33Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T12:14:33Z","body":"Cherry-picked for 4.5.2.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734474396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734521941","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114839#issuecomment-3734521941","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114839","id":3734521941,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7emEhV","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T12:52:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T13:59:40Z","body":"For posterity; this is a workaround to fix a problem in the BasisUniversal code base. This is not a workaround for a bug in GCC.\r\n\r\n\"strict aliasing\" is a rule in the C spec that says two pointers to the same memory location cannot be of different type, so for instance the following would break strict aliasing rules:\r\n\r\n```\r\nint process(int *i, float *f) {\r\n    *i = 42;\r\n    *f = 3.14f;\r\n    return *i; // Expects i !== f because pointer types of i and f are different.\r\n               // With -fno-strict-aliasing gcc will reload *i before returning\r\n}\r\n\r\nint a = 1000;\r\nint *b = &a;\r\nfloat *c = ((float*)(&a));\r\nint d = process(b, c); // The question here is will d be 42, or the integer representation of 3.14f?\r\n                       // with strict aliasing it will return 42, without strict aliasing the bit pattern of 3.14f\r\n```\r\n\r\nApparently basis universal does something like this, which is undefined behavior, and gcc thus assumes that it DOESN'T do this and doesn't generate code to handle the \"This pointer points to both an int and float\" case. Because it doesn't have to handle that, because you're not allowed to do that.\r\n\r\nSo clang/msvc's implementation of this \"undefined behavior\" just happens to be what basis universal expects it seems. Or either of them simply don't do any optimization that depend on there not being aliasing. I can't know which is which.\r\n\r\nBut it is NOT a GCC bug!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734521941/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756012390","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114839#issuecomment-3756012390","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114839","id":3756012390,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f4DNm","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T17:21:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T17:21:42Z","body":"Tested on 4.6-rc1, the issue has been resolved. Thank you for looking into it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756012390/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]